10:Ta19,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』天伝 蒼空の兵 −大坂冬の陣−","description":"360度回転する劇場「IHIステージアラウンド東京」という規格外の舞台機構を使いこなし、大坂の陣を二部作で描く壮大なプロジェクトの前編。 慶長十九年、大坂。徳川陣営の偵察にあたる一期一振ら藤四郎兄弟は、家康の傍らに潜む怪しげな従者の存在を察知する。一方、山姥切国広、加州清光、宗三左文字は、要所・真田丸へと潜入。そこで彼らは、かつて小田原の地で相まみえた「ある男」と再会し、拭いきれない不穏な気配を感じ取る。謎の刀剣男士・太閤左文字との出会い、そして時間遡行軍に狙われる豊臣秀頼の護衛任務。広大なステージと最新の映像技術を駆使したかつてないスケールの殺陣と共に、大坂の地に渦巻く「物語」の正体が暴かれていく。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-tenden","keywords":"群像のうまみ, 殺陣厚め, 世界観つよめ, 演出強め","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"本田 礼生","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/honda-reo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"前嶋 曜","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/maejima-yoh"},{"@type":"Person","name":"北川 尚弥","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kitagawa-naoya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"佐々木 喜英","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sasaki-yoshihide"},{"@type":"Person","name":"松田 凌","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/matsuda-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"北乃 颯希","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kitano-satsuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"鈴木 裕樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/suzuki-hiroki1"},{"@type":"Person","name":"姜 暢雄","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kyo-nobuo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"小松 準弥","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/komatsu-junya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"日南田 顕久","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hinata-akihisa"},{"@type":"Person","name":"安田 桃太郎","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yasuda-momotaro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"杉山 圭一","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sugiyama-keiichi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"松村 雄基","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/matsumura-yuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"}]}5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stack-lg","ch